    "chunk_text": "wylc is min nehsta? \u00d0a cw\u00e6\u00fe se H\u00e6lend hine upbeseonde, Sum man ferde fram Hierusalem to Hiericho & becom on \u00fea \u00dea gebyrode hit \u00fe\u00e6t sum sacerd ferde on \u00feam ylcan wege & \u00fea he \u00fe\u00e6t geseah he hine forbeh, & \u00d0a ferde sum Samaritanisc man wi\u00f0 hine. \u00dea he hine geseah \u00fea wear\u00f0 he mid mildheortnesse ofer hine astyred. \u00dea geneal\u00e6hte he & wra\u00f0 his wunda & onaget ele & win, & hine on hys nyten sette & gel\u00e6dde on Hwylc \u00feara \u00fereora \u00feync\u00f0 \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6t sy \u00fe\u00e6s m\u00e6g, \u00fee on \u00f0a scea\u00f0an befeoll. \u00d0a cw\u00e6\u00f0 he, Se \u00f0e him mildheortnesse on dyde. \u00d0a cw\u00e6\u00fe se h\u00e6lend, ga & do eall swa. So\u00f0lice hit w\u00e6s geworden \u00fea hig ferdon, se H\u00e6lend eode on sum castel & sum wif on naman & \u00fe\u00e6re swustur w\u00e6s Maria, seo eac s\u00e6t wi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6s h\u00e6lendes fet & his word gehyrde. So\u00felice Martha geornlice him \u00feenode. \u00dea stod heo & cw\u00e6\u00fe, Drihten, nis \u00fee nan caru \u00fe\u00e6t min swustur let me \u00e6nlipie \u00feenian; Sege hyre \u00fe\u00e6t \u00d0a cw\u00e6\u00fe se H\u00e6lend, Martha Martha, geornfull \u00feu eart & embe fela \u00feinga gedrefed. Gewislice an \u00feing is niedbehefe. Maria geces \u00fe\u00e6ne selestan d\u00e6l, se hyre ne by\u00f0 afyrred. So\u00f0lice w\u00e6s geworden \u00fea he w\u00e6s on sumere stowe hine gebiddende, \u00fea \u00fea he geswac, him to cw\u00e6",
